    `s 487.055(3) the Criminal Code, chapter C-34 of the Revised Statutes of Canada, 1970, as it read from time to time before January 4, 1983`
    `s 487.055(3) the Criminal Code, chapter C-34 of the Revised Statutes of Canada, 1970, as it read from time to time before January 1, 1988`

