    `provision`                                        IS A `Provision of the Code`
    `it is an attempt to commit that offence`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the indictable offence referred to in subsection 348(1) is itself a sexual offence within the meaning of paragraph (a), (b), (c) or (d)` IS A BOOLEAN

