-- src:9601 | (iv) section 155 (incest),
-- src:9602 | (v) subsection 212(4) (offence in relation to juvenile prostitution),
-- src:9603 | (vi) section 271 (sexual assault),
-- src:9604 | (vii) section 272 (sexual assault with a weapon, threats to a third party or causing bodily harm), and
